    "updated_at": "2018-03-09T15:26:00Z",
    "body": "I would not mention execCommand anywhere except in those exceptional cases where there is no alternative way of doing something, the number of which hopefully very soon will be zero. Also, it's kind of difficult to say that nonstandard feature X is not allowed to do Y, isn't it? If it does allow Y, it's non-standard, which is what it was in the first place.",
