    "created_at": "2018-03-14T07:03:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-14T07:03:51Z",
    "body": "I agree there should not be any sandbox escapes anywhere, even in non-standardized features. \r\nAs for adding new things to the execCommand draft spec: we have had a long discussion about this in the editing taskforce in the past and browser makers made it clear in no uncertain terms that they will completely ignore those draft specs. So before anyone puts more time and energy into this, I think we should try to find out if there is any change in the view of browser makers.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
